        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 24441, Decorative Rope Mortise Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Decorative Rope Door Knob Mortise Lockset is available in a wide array of traditional finishes. The rope detailing adds to the sense of traditionalism. It is a true classic with attention to detail that makes it a beautiful addition to homes or commercial settings. The  Decorative Rope Mortise Entryset is available in several lockable functions like single cylinder and panic proof as well as passage, privacy, and dummy sets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available for standard pre-drilled doors: <a href=\"/products/victorian-rope-door-knob-entry-lockset-omnia-d24441\">Omnia D24441</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Rope Mortise Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 24441 Rope Knob Mortise Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1⁄2” b.s.: with 3-7⁄8” minimum stile</li>\r\n<li>2-3⁄4” b.s.: with 4-1⁄2” minimum stile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike.4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions and Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair:</b> Stationary both sides of door. Fixed knobs, non-functioning. Used as door pulls or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall / Closet):</b> The latch is operated by a knob from either side.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bathroom / Bedroom):</b> The latch operates by a knob from either side. Deadbolt is operated by a turnpiece inside and emergency key outside. Turning inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by knob inside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Entry:</b>  Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by knob inside. Deadbolt activated only by key from either side. </li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside.  Turning inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob inside and by key outside. The outside knob is rigid. Auxiliary latchbolt deadlocks latchbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-nickel-pinapple.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"600\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Decorative Rope Door Knob Mortise Lockset",
                "description": "The Decorative Rope Door Knob Mortise Lockset is available in a wide array of traditional finishes. The rope detailing adds to the sense of traditionalism. It is a true classic with attention to detail that makes it a beautiful addition to homes or commercial settings. The  Decorative Rope Mortise Entryset is available in several lockable functions like single cylinder and panic proof as well as passage, privacy, and dummy sets. \r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-24441 Decorative Rope Door Knob Mortise Locksets, Omnia 24441 Mortise Locksets, omnia deadbolt, omnia commercial mortise deadbolts, omnia #441 door knobs, omnia 441 knobs, victorian knobs, rope door knobs,"
